         <change when="2025-06-01T05:51:07-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Vote - AcceptText - μάνγανα in lin25 in is fine. ἅ|π̣αντα in lins25–6 is preferable to the earlier ἀ|[λί]β̣αντα. ἐν γ̣ό̣μοις is imaginative and imaginable but unparalleled; the reading is also not easy: something for the apparatus rather than the text.  Note ἐν was omitted from the new version by oversight.</change>
