         <change when="2025-05-16T10:26:08-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Commit - Corrected some DDbDP typos: lin7 κιστὰς =&gt; κίστας; lin20 &lt;:ῥητίνας|reg|ῥητε̣ί̣νας:&gt; =&gt; ῥητίνης (ed. pr.) confirmed on the image. Furthermore, in lin25 μανέανα =&gt; μάνγανα (l. μάγγανα), lin25-26: ἀ|[λί]β̣αντα ἐν ι[  ̣]μις =&gt; ἅ|π̣αντα ἐν γ̣ό̣μοις. I've also removed the unnecessary square brackets in number 85 on the same line. </change>
